{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年44歲的陳自瑤 （Yoyo）是「人妻天花板」，身為人妻人母，身材仍然從未走樣，樣靚身材正。陳自瑤與視帝老公王浩信齊齊北上發展，陳自瑤主力經營帶貨直播，榮升帶貨吸金女王。陳自瑤曾因帶貨直播壓力大到爆喊吸氧；又試過完成直播後，攤坐地上吃半個凍漢堡包醫肚，搵錢不易。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤貼地幫襯街邊檔。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136350119688409088169523.jpeg/yB28JZdg0wZOJ3-xGLnzFyxKZOhlvjymk-kY7pPpGO4\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤貼地幫襯街邊檔。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤韓國vlog。(抖音截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136350124050747392827615.jpeg/cYoi6r7pafQ6RH5D3_MiRX8cvY7r8IAnmw-14psPteI\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤韓國vlog。(抖音截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>陳自瑤一日食11餐</p><p>陳自瑤近日上載遊海南的片段。片段中，陳自瑤在海南由朝食到晚，日頭已經開始飲椰青，到了夜晚，陳自瑤行夜市，她坦言：「其實我是很喜歡逛夜市的。」陳自瑤首先開始飲果汁，水果、燒蠔、海鮮粥，甚麼都嘗試，歎了這麼多美食，陳自瑤個肚仍有空間，最後連甜品都食埋。陳自瑤透露，當日食足11餐：「海南一日食11頓」。雖然化了妝，但看得出陳自瑤有淡淡的黑眼圈，顯得有些少疲倦，看來工作奔波。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤海南一日食足11餐。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877792604688384206451.png/5UsoxRkhGm60_2hdEOVtbxC2xqpVANBIU2SlAFNkpQA\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤海南一日食足11餐。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"行夜市。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877790033448960294517.png/mcOOjubZN3p24E19Ll_oPqSiKdjZUftYrld0Iq5XdCI\"/><figcaption>行夜市。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"飲果汁。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877809487155200203418.png/WRbxnZsuFEycU4C8XHf-MmSoIe9idXOAL1qvKi9aryo\"/><figcaption>飲果汁。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水果。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877807003996160570143.png/ct8RPS360agOd4M7G9dPLv8fIXebPCqwwEL4msBC-Jo\"/><figcaption>水果。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"燒蠔。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877804533420032651420.png/FB9lPwIk3deVeL5_otFn8KPfcF_2qIw6dXE1Z3VxNWc\"/><figcaption>燒蠔。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"海鮮。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877802029289472691340.png/MWpH07FwryUEq8962nD8rwEmHpTag_bhA9L9UQPS_VE\"/><figcaption>海鮮。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260531/1137877799579684864673485.png/h7i8NYeJMNV5BUqlCifb2QBJ2qTq7HVU4wcYZeMHGGU\"/><figcaption>勁！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T03:18:50.946423+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":437,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}